Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:33:53 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 26/32] pine(L2): register chat.sendToNewChat.enabled

A generic setting, default true, for whether Chat offers Send to New Chat. The Studio's extension sets it false
: the person's reply to a session waiting for their answer went to a new session and a new
Computer, twice, through Send to New Chat, which they did not mean to use.

diff --git a/src/vs/workbench/contrib/pine/browser/pine.contribution.ts b/src/vs/workbench/contrib/pine/browser/pine.contribution.ts
index df5e0a0d4ba..8522dca0065 100644
--- a/src/vs/workbench/contrib/pine/browser/pine.contribution.ts
+++ b/src/vs/workbench/contrib/pine/browser/pine.contribution.ts
@@ -42,6 +42,21 @@ Registry.as<IConfigurationRegistry>(ConfigurationExtensions.Configuration).regis
 	},
 });
 
+// Whether Chat offers Send to New Chat (chatExecuteActions.ts SendToNewChatAction: Ctrl/Cmd+Shift+Enter, and the Send
+// button's alternative while Alt is held, or Shift with the pointer over it; menuEntryActionViewItem.ts). It sends the
+// typed message to a new conversation instead of the one shown. The Studio's extension turns it off (pine-drama-studio
+// a reply meant for a waiting session started a new session and a new Computer instead.
+Registry.as<IConfigurationRegistry>(ConfigurationExtensions.Configuration).registerConfiguration({
+	id: 'chat',
+	properties: {
+		'chat.sendToNewChat.enabled': {
+			type: 'boolean',
+			default: true,
+			description: 'Controls whether Chat offers Send to New Chat (its keybinding and the Send button\'s alternative).',
+		},
+	},
+});
+
